(87768: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %2F%2F%20Retain%20the%20complete%20inputs%20of%20historical%20controls%20after%20current%20CI%20repairs.%0Aimport%20assert%20from%20%27node%3Aassert%2Fstrict%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7BcreateHash%7D%20from%20%27node%3Acrypto%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7BreadFileSync%2CwriteFileSync%7D%20from%20%27node%3Afs%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7BfileURLToPath%7D%20from%20%27node%3Aurl%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7BrestoreNativeCompatibilitySourceHistory%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fnative-compatibility-source-history.mjs%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7BrestoreRawDescriptorHistoricalSource%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fraw-descriptor-historical-cohort.mjs%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7BcaptureGitArtifactCertificate%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fcapture-git-artifact-certificate.mjs%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7BverifyGitArtifactCertificate%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fgit-object-certificate.mjs%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7BreadProjectData%2CcheckProjectData%2CwriteProjectData%2CserializeProjectData%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fproject-data.mjs%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7BreadStructuredDataLino%7D%20from%20%27..%2Fsrc%2Fstructured-data-links.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7BrestoreRawConsumingSnapshotSource%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fraw-consuming-snapshot-source-profile.mjs%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7BrestoreProgramStringSourceDescriptorEdge%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fprogram-string-source-descriptors.mjs%27%3B%0A%0Aconst%20root%3Dnew%20URL%28%27..%2F..%2F%27%2Cimport.meta.url%29%2Crevision%3D%27d1232503fb38246f7e28f5d414c882a70944b38b%27%3B%0Aconst%20pin%3Dvalue%3D%3E%28%7Bbytes%3ABuffer.byteLength%28value%29%2Csha256%3AcreateHash%28%27sha256%27%29.update%28value%29.digest%28%27hex%27%29%7D%29%3B%0Aconst%20arrayHistory%3DreadProjectData%28new%20URL%28%27parity%2Fself-translation%2Farray-relative-element-history.lino%27%2Croot%29%29%3B%0Aconst%20rangeHistory%3DreadProjectData%28new%20URL%28%27parity%2Fself-translation%2Foriginal-number-source-range-history.lino%27%2Croot%29%29%3B%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20These%20two%20current%20inputs%20have%20separate%20authenticated%20source%2Fdescriptor%0A%20%2A%20successors.%20Reuse%20those%20complete%20inverses%20before%20selecting%20this%20author%27s%0A%20%2A%20original%20cohort%3B%20every%20actual%20current%20gate%20remains%20separate%20and%20unchanged.%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20restoreContinuationHistoricalAuthorInput%28source%2Cfile%29%7B%0A%20%20assert.equal%28typeof%20source%2C%27string%27%29%3Bassert.equal%28typeof%20file%2C%27string%27%29%3B%0A%20%20source%3DrestoreRawDescriptorHistoricalSource%28source%2Cfile%2C%27continuation%20historical%20input%27%29%3B%0A%20%20if%28%5B%27js%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Fcheck.js%27%2C%27parity%2Fself-translation%2Fcomplete-declaration-receipts.lino%27%5D.includes%28file%29%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20historical%3B%0A%20%20%20%20if%28file%3D%3D%3D%27js%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Fcheck.js%27%29historical%3DrestoreRawConsumingSnapshotSource%28Buffer.from%28source%29%2Cfile%2Ctrue%29.toString%28%27utf8%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20else%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20const%20value%3DreadStructuredDataLino%28source%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20assert.equal%28serializeProjectData%28value%2Cfile%29%2Csource%2C%27the%20complete%20selected%20register%20spelling%20must%20be%20canonical%20before%20its%20original%20whole-byte%20gates%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20historical%3DserializeProjectData%28restoreProgramStringSourceDescriptorEdge%28null%2C%27historical%20register%27%2Cvalue%29.register%2Cfile%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%20%20%20%20const%20row%3DarrayHistory.sources.find%28row%3D%3Erow.file%3D%3D%3Dfile%29%3Bassert.ok%28row%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20if%28historical%21%3D%3Dsource%7C%7Cpin%28source%29.sha256%3D%3D%3Drow.current.sha256%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20assert.deepEqual%28pin%28historical%29%2Crow.current%2C%27the%20entire%20independently%20selected%20historical%20author%20input%20must%20retain%20its%20original%20identity%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20historical%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%20%20%20%20source%3Dhistorical%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20return%20restoreNativeCompatibilitySourceHistory%28file%2Csource%29%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Freeze%20exact%20predecessor%20views%3B%20no%20current%20artifact%20or%20implementation%20is%20rewritten.%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20generateContinuationHistoricalInputs%28%7Bcheck%3Dfalse%7D%3D%7B%7D%29%20%7B%0A%20%20const%20profiles%3Dnew%20Map%28%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20include%3D%28file%2Cprofile%2Cexpected%29%3D%3E%7B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20entry%3Dprofiles.get%28file%29%3F%3F%7Bprofiles%3A%5B%5D%2Cexpected%7D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20assert.deepEqual%28entry.expected%2Cexpected%29%3Bentry.profiles.push%28profile%29%3Bprofiles.set%28file%2Centry%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%3B%0A%20%20for%28const%20row%20of%20arrayHistory.sources%29include%28row.file%2C%27relative%20array%27%2Crow.current%29%3B%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20This%20library%20is%20an%20input%20of%20the%20old%20descriptor%20generator%2C%20not%20one%20of%20its%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20outputs.%20Its%20current%20packaging%20is%20verified%20by%20the%20independent%20current%20gate.%0A%20%20const%20library%3D%27parity%2Fself-translation%2Fcollection-construction-rules-native.lino%27%3B%0A%20%20include%28library%2C%27relative%20array%27%2Cpin%28captureGitArtifactCertificate%28revision%2Clibrary%29.blob%29%29%3B%0A%20%20for%28const%20row%20of%20rangeHistory.sources%29include%28row.file%2C%27original%20number%20source%20ranges%27%2Crow.current%29%3B%0A%20%20for%28const%20row%20of%20rangeHistory.unchanged%29include%28row.file%2C%27original%20number%20source%20ranges%27%2C%7Bbytes%3Arow.bytes%2Csha256%3Arow.sha256%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20include%28rangeHistory.previousReceipt.file%2C%27original%20number%20source%20ranges%27%2CrangeHistory.currentReceipt%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20sources%3D%5B%5D%3B%0A%20%20for%28const%20%5Bfile%2C%7Bprofiles%3Aroles%2Cexpected%7D%5Dof%20profiles%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20actual%3DrestoreContinuationHistoricalAuthorInput%28readFileSync%28new%20URL%28file%2Croot%29%2C%27utf8%27%29%2Cfile%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20if%28pin%28actual%29.sha256%3D%3D%3Dexpected.sha256%29continue%3B%0A%20%20%20